  "operative_text": "Section 1 (new section, chapter 62.1-01) subsection 1: A personal firearm, firearm accessory, or ammunition manufactured commercially or privately in the state and which remains within the state is not subject to federal law or federal regulation, including registration as those items are not subject to regulations related to interstate commerce.\nSection 1 (new section, chapter 62.1-01) subsection 3: Firearms accessories imported into the state from another state and which are subject to federal regulation as being in interstate commerce do not subject a firearm to federal regulation under interstate commerce because the accessories are attached to or used with a firearm in the state."
}